{"thread":{"threadID":3884,"boardID":166,"topic":"Map Vorschlag: mg_100traps_v4_1","time":1478005295,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","lastPostTime":1478217207,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":5,"views":392,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":398,"name":"wunsch"}],"posts":[{"postID":51421,"threadID":3884,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","subject":"Map Vorschlag: mg_100traps_v4_1","time":1478005295,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1478179669,"value":1},{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1478239628,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo,<br>ich hätte einen Map Wunsch für den Minigame Sevrer.<br>Die Map heißt 100traps, und wie der Name es schon sagt gibt es 100Level (Fallen).<br>Der Downloadlink: <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=510119667\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51431,"threadID":3884,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1478008930,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hab sie mir runtergeladen und angespielt, ich finde sie hat Potenzial und ist gut gemacht.<br>Die Level sind abwechslungsreich und machen Spaß. Könnte sich durchaus im Map Pool blicken lassen.<br><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51439,"threadID":3884,"userID":2287,"username":"Krokoblack","subject":"","time":1478018795,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Neue Maps sind immer gut.  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">👍</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51442,"threadID":3884,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1478021157,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>mg_100traps_v4_1 war die beste Minigames Map in CSS <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51498,"threadID":3884,"userID":2214,"username":"Berkay","subject":"","time":1478205060,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Einfach nur Ja</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":51506,"threadID":3884,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1478217207,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1478217662,"value":1},{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1478239623,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2356-derxxlmario/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@DerXXLMario</a>,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>danke für den Vorschlag. Wir haben uns die Map angeschaut, sie ist auch gut, jedoch haben wir mapübergreifend feste Rundenzeiten, die für eine Map mit 100 Stages nicht ausreichen. Es ist also nicht möglich, diese in der gegebenen Zeit zu absolvieren.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Leider können wir also die Map nicht einführen.<br>Erneut vielen Dank für die Hilfe.</p>","polls":[]}]}